			"notes": "- (Heavenly) Breaking Change: `SizedBlock` now use the new `SizeManager`, which improves their management by a lot.\n- Add `SizedBlock#getPlacementOrigin`, which allow modders to choose the inner position at which the sized block will be deployed on placement (and thus shifting it whole placement).\n- Add Dynamic Size support for sized blocks (will probably receive tweaks and fixes in the future).\n- Add (back, iirc) Rendering Module, featuring Special Block Renderers.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MModding/mmodding-library/compare/0.8.0...0.9.0"
		},
